{"kode":"BUDI","sumber":"Stockbit profile","dipanen_pada":"2026-08-23","address":[{"id":"102","email":["alice.yuliana@sungaibudi.com "],"fax":"021-5213339, 5213392 ","npwp":"01.221.127.2-054.000 / 0012211272054000","phone":"021-5213383 ","website":"http://www.budistarchsweetener.com ","key":"","lastupdate":"2024-12-20T15:03:10+07:00","value":"","office":"Wisma Budi Lantai 8-9. Jl H.R.Rasuna Said Kav C6 "}],"background":"PT Budi Starch & Sweetener Tbk, didirikan pada tahun 1979 dengan nama awal PT North Aspac Chemical Industrial Company, merupakan bagian dari kelompok usaha agribisnis besar Sungai Budi Group (SBG) yang telah berdiri sejak 1947. Perusahaan ini bergerak di bidang industri pengolahan berbasis singkong, dengan merek dan produk utama meliputi tepung tapioka, glukosa, fruktosa, maltodextrin, asam sulfat, serta karung plastik. Saat ini, Budi Starch & Sweetener tengah fokus memperluas pasar domestik dan ekspor, serta meningkatkan kapasitas dan efisiensi produksi melalui riset dan pengembangan berbasis singkong, termasuk pengembangan bibit unggul. Bersama entitas anak, perusahaan memiliki pabrik yang tersebar di Lampung, Jawa Timur, Jawa Tengah, dan Sulawesi Selatan, serta melayani pelanggan di dalam negeri dan negara-negara seperti AS, Arab Saudi, dan Australia.","history":{"amount":"90 B","board":"Papan Utama","date":"8 May 1995","price":"3,000","registrar":"","shares":"30,000,000","underwriters":["PT. Inter-Pacific Securities","PT. Lippo Securities","PT. DBS Securities Indonesia"],"administrative_bureau":"PT Sinartama Gunita","free_float":"40.06%"},"key_executive":{"commissioner":[{"id":"41904373","key":"Commissioner","lastupdate":"2026-08-21T15:29:10+07:00","value":"OEY ALFRED"}],"director":[{"id":"41904380","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2026-08-21T15:29:10+07:00","value":"JASON INDRIAN WINATA"},{"id":"41904379","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2026-08-21T15:29:10+07:00","value":"OEY ALBERT"},{"id":"41904378","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2026-08-21T15:29